<title>USA: Fed says overnight system repo totals $1.70 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says overnight system repo totals $1.70 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it added $1.70 billion to the banking system through its overnight system repurchase agreements on Thursday.</p>
<p>((--N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1679))</p>
